  "review": "Candidate for the seat: C10-S5 catalog contract product b110f4a8b286a737b1dc46e9093a66110b3589d5 after the coordinator's source review. OperationStore.constructor (accepted as reviewed): one WeakSet.add for a preview store. OperationStore.record: the INSERT's statement, bound values, returned entry and transaction are unchanged; the event text is computed once and bound unchanged; after the INSERT a total, guarded noteCommitted records seq and that exact text in the request's fiber-local cell (no SQL, no throw, no reordering). Settlement after the request confirms a note only by seq, outcome='committed' and byte-identical event text. Models, invariants, bounds and crash insertion points are unchanged.",
